      "description": "72-ARKM-G3 \"Banshee\" Rheinland Fighter\nAs a steed is bred for its strength as well as its grace, this majestic fighter carries on the long and distinguished tradition of Rheinland military craft. The Banshee is simply the finest ship of its kind. Its craftsmanship, its unwavering precision and reliability, and its substantial offerings for an accessible price all demonstrate Rheinland’s commitment to excellence.",
