      "description": "AP-7031 \"Barracuda\" Bounty Hunter Heavy Fighter\nWhen the fire is thick and flack and fallout rip the competition apart, the Barracuda still fights. Because of its strength and survivability in open combat as well as its stealthy, maneuverable handling, this ship distinguishes itself as the best friend of the modern Bounty Hunter. This, coupled with the tricked-out power array, makes it an easy choice.",
